%% title: From design to printed card and QR check
%% desc: A ready-made design becomes a draft. Publishing makes a version. The admin makes one version the default. You check the preview, choose a printer and print. The print record carries a QR code. Scanning the QR shows the document as valid or revoked.
flowchart TD
  T["New design<br/>starts as draft"]:::admin --> P["Publish<br/>makes a version"]:::admin
  P --> D["Make default"]:::admin
  D --> V["Preview"]
  V --> C["Choose printer"]:::admin
  C --> R["Print<br/>record with QR"]
  R -.-> S["Scan the QR"]:::public
  S --> OK["Valid"]:::public
  S --> NO["Revoked"]:::note
  classDef admin fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#e8590c,color:#7a2e05
  classDef public fill:#ebfbee,stroke:#2b8a3e,color:#14411d
  classDef note fill:#f1f3f5,stroke:#868e96,color:#343a40
